. * --- pair covariate: 1 if two employees have the same direct supervisor ---
. mata:
------------------------------------------------- mata (type end to exit) --------
: V = st_sdata(., "supervisor")

: n = rows(V)

: S = J(n, n, 0)

: for (i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
>     for (j = 1; j <= n; j++) S[i, j] = (i != j) & (V[i] != "") & (V[i] == V[j])
> }

: end
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

. nwset, mat(S) name(samesup) directed

. nwset
(2 networks)
--------------------
      mail
      samesup

. 
